How to run:

    Compilation: 
        1. Please be in the working directory. i.e ../project1_Kanec_Olivares. Do not move around STAY HERE
        2. Next run in the terminal
            cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug
            cmake --build build
            
    
    Running:
        1. ./build/main <filename_of_input> 
            1a. Must be txt!!!
            1b. If no file name is specified I will take input.txt as the default

    List of files:
        process.h: Is a header file that contains my Resource and Process data types.
        main.cpp: The main file where I keep the PCB, RCB, WL, RL, all necesary functions that
                in order for the Extended Manager to run.
        CMakeLists.txt: CMake for easy compilation

